<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<section class="section"><div class="container" style="max-width:880px">
  <div class="about-head"><img src="/static/brand/liv-seal-color.svg" alt="" width="120" height="120"><div>
    <span class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--gold)">About <%= brand %></span>
    <h1><%= brandLong %></h1>
    <p class="muted" style="font-size:1.08rem;margin:0"><%= brand %> — <%= brandLong %> — is a U.S.-based private professional credentialing and verification organization headquartered in Virginia, United States.</p>
  </div></div>
  <p class="mt"><strong><%= brandLine %></strong></p>
  <h2 class="mt">Our name</h2>
  <div class="grid g3">
    <div class="card"><h3><span class="gold-l">L</span>eadership</h3><p class="muted mb0">Credentials that move professionals from doing the work to governing it.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3><span class="gold-l">I</span>nstitute</h3><p class="muted mb0">An organization dedicated to defined standards, quality control and accountability.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3><span class="gold-l">V</span>alidation</h3><p class="muted mb0">Competence is validated against a scheme, and every credential can be verified in seconds.</p></div>
  </div>
  <h2 class="mt">What we do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Own and maintain professional credential schemes: competency frameworks, assessment requirements, credential rules, quality controls and the credential lifecycle.</li>
    <li>Authorize education partners to deliver education within an approved scope, and keep them under surveillance.</li>
    <li>Record credential decisions and issue credentials with unique IDs and signed QR codes.</li>
    <li>Run a public verification service with live status, including revocation.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2 class="mt">Types of <%= brand %> records</h2>
  <p>Not every <%= brand %> record means the same thing. Each verification page states which type it is. <a href="/credentials">See credential types →</a></p>
  <div class="alert info small"><%= brand %> is a private organization operated by <%= legalEntity %>. It is not a government agency or a regulatory authority, is not recognized by the U.S. Department of Education or CHEA, and does not claim ISO or any other external accreditation or recognition. Its credentials and partner authorizations do not grant degrees, government licenses or registration with any professional body, and do not guarantee the competence or performance of any individual.</div>
  <h2 class="mt">Leadership</h2>
  <div class="grid g3">
    <div class="card"><h3>[Name]</h3><p class="muted mb0">President</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>[Name]</h3><p class="muted mb0">Director of Credentialing</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>[Name]</h3><p class="muted mb0">Chief Technology Officer</p></div>
  </div>
  <p class="small muted mt"><%= brand %> and <%= brandLong %> are trade names of <%= legalEntity %>, a limited liability company registered in the United States. [Registered address]</p>
</div></section>
<%- include('../partials/foot') %>
